#ASSERT `How does s 29 treat me at my age` (Date 1 1 2009) (Date 20 11 2021) EQUALS `responsible only if capacity to know is proved, 10 to 13`
#ASSERT `How does s 29 treat me at my age` (Date 30 8 2006) (Date 29 8 2020) EQUALS `responsible only if capacity to know is proved, 10 to 13`
#ASSERT `How does s 29 treat me at my age` (Date 30 8 2006) (Date 30 8 2020) EQUALS `criminally responsible as anyone is, 14 or over`

